 "control": {
  "state_source": false,
  "agency": "MDOT SHA Survey (HARN / project GPS control); MD iMAP imagery control points are photogrammetric ground control, not survey monument networks",
  "sources": [],
  "finding": "No public statewide MD survey-control FeatureServer/MapServer found for cadastral/geodetic monuments. MDOT SHA Surveyors Information page offers NGS links, a HARN map, and a downloadable KML of MDOT SHA GPS control (contact survey@mdot.maryland.gov for point details) — not a queryable REST layer. Local leads (not used as state source): Anne Arundel Survey Monuments (gis.aacounty.org OpenData/Utility_Survey_OpenData/MapServer/0, 3,346 marks with SPC83 + Year_Set + Card_Link); Harford SurveyControlPoints (hcggis Hosted/Survey_Control_Points_Webmap_Map_WFL1). MD iMAP ImageryAcquisitionFlightInformation control points are orthophoto GCPs, not NGS/HARN monuments.",
